# Provider API keys do NOT belong here any more.
#
# OpenAI / Anthropic / Gemini / Azure keys are configured in the app itself
# (sidebar → "Provider settings"). They are stored encrypted in the local file
# backend/data/app.db, with exactly one provider marked active for chat.
# Nothing on the request path reads OPENAI_API_KEY & co.
#
# The only optional setting left is the master key used to encrypt those stored
# keys. Leave it unset and one is generated on first run at backend/data/.secret_key.
# Set it explicitly if you want the same app.db to be readable on another machine.

# APP_SECRET_KEY=
